      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This ruling contradicts the VRChat documentation on IsAnimatorEnabled and VRChat Performance Options. Disabling animators was avoided before, but was implemented in 2025.1.1 and given a parameter to allow creators to work around the potential desync issues. There is no current way for creators to work around turned-around culling, because the IsAnimatorEnabled parameter does not enable.",
